                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16910325" author="dpavlov" created="Mon, 19 Aug 2019 11:08:05 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vveider&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vveider&quot;&gt;vveider&lt;/a&gt;, WDYT about including version update (solution 2) to our script - ignite/scripts/update-versions.sh ?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16910433" author="vveider" created="Mon, 19 Aug 2019 14:07:24 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Unfortunately, this process cannot be automated in such a manner due to packaging policies and best practices.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Solution: before RC build is attempted, manual changes should be made in &lt;tt&gt;packaging/deb/changelog&lt;/tt&gt; and &lt;tt&gt;packaging/rpm/apache-ignite.spec&lt;/tt&gt; respectfully: add new version definition above the last one.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16911619" author="dpavlov" created="Tue, 20 Aug 2019 18:12:54 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Doc &lt;a href=&quot;https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/IGNITE/Release+Process#ReleaseProcess-4.1.3.UpdateDEB&amp;amp;RPMpackageversion&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/IGNITE/Release+Process#ReleaseProcess-4.1.3.UpdateDEB&amp;amp;RPMpackageversion&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

